{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18802","headline":"有獭吟 · 刘禹锡","name":"有獭吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有獭得嘉鱼，自谓天见怜。\n先祭不敢食，捧鳞望青玄。\n人立寒沙上，心专眼悁悁。\n渔翁以爲妖，举块投其咽。\n呼儿贯鱼归，与獭同烹煎。\n关关黄金鹗，大[翅]摇江烟。\n下见盈寻鱼，投身擘洪连。\n攫拏隐鳞去，哺雏林岳巅。\n鸱乌欲伺隙，遥噪莫敢前。\n长居青云路，弹射无由缘。\n何地无江湖，何水无鲔鱣。\n天意不宰割，菲祭徒虔虔。\n空余知礼重，载在淹中篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}